    "collapsible_content_PteKmH": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_U6BcxG": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What gender reveal party supplies do you offer?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We offer a wide range of gender reveal party supplies, including <a href=\"https:\/\/genderrevealideas.com.au\/collections\/gender-reveal-smoke-bombs-australia\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">smoke bombs<\/span><\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/genderrevealideas.com.au\/collections\/gender-reveal-cannons\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">confetti cannons<\/span><\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/genderrevealideas.com.au\/collections\/powder-gender-reveals-australia\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">powder blasters<\/span><\/a>, and more! Whether you’re looking for low-mess kits or elaborate bundles, we have everything you need to create an unforgettable gender reveal. Shop our full range of party supplies to complete your celebration!<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_UPaxFy": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are some unique baby gender reveal ideas?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><a href=\"https:\/\/genderrevealideas.com.au\/blogs\/news\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Looking for baby gender reveal ideas? <\/span><\/a>We offer a variety of exciting options, from sports-themed kits to fun confetti bursts and smoke bomb reveals. Whether you prefer a dramatic moment or a more intimate celebration, our kits and bundles will make your reveal memorable. Explore our collection for inspiration!<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_6KGwRM": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What should I include in my baby gender reveal?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>For a complete baby gender reveal, you’ll need a <a href=\"https:\/\/genderrevealideas.com.au\/collections\/gender-reveal-bundles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">gender reveal kit <\/span><\/a>or one of our reveal products (smoke bombs, cannons, blasters or more), <a href=\"https:\/\/genderrevealideas.com.au\/collections\/gender-reveal-balloons\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">decorations<\/span><\/a>, and fun accessories. Our gender reveal bundles have everything pre-curated, so you can easily find the perfect set for your celebration!<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_afLByc": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I know which gender reveal bundle to choose?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Choosing the right gender reveal product depends on your preferred style. Whether you want a low-mess reveal with our Mini Blasters or an explosive moment with confetti cannons, we have a variety of options to suit your celebration. Browse our <a href=\"https:\/\/genderrevealideas.com.au\/collections\/gender-reveal-bundles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">gender reveal bundles<\/span><\/a> for a curated experience!<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_tk7CLx": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I get a bundle for my baby reveal party?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! Our gender reveal bundles are perfect for your reveal party. Each bundle includes carefully selected items such as smoke bombs, confetti cannons, powder blasters, and even themed decorations, ensuring your reveal is seamless and fun.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_VxdJY9": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "When is the best time for a baby gender reveal?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The best time for a baby gender reveal is typically between the 18th and 20th week of pregnancy, when the gender can be accurately determined through an ultrasound. Our gender reveal kits are designed to make your reveal easy, exciting, and unforgettable!<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_4xTMYi": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do gender reveal smoke bombs stain?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Gender Reveal Smoke Bombs can stain if discharged directly onto materials like clothing, furniture, or walls - particularly in enclosed or indoor spaces. However, when used in an open, well-ventilated area, there's little to no risk of staining, as the smoke disperses into the air. Any residue that does occur is typically washable. For best results, we recommend using smoke bombs outdoors or indoors with windows open and plenty of ventilation to minimise any risk of staining.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_iRKJQT": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are gender reveal smoke bombs legal?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes – but only ours are officially legal in Australia. Gender Reveal Ideas is proud to offer the only government-approved gender reveal smoke bombs on the market, registered with Resources Safety & Health Queensland.<\/p><p>Many other websites sell illegal imitations that have not been approved and may pose safety risks. Our smoke bombs are made using non-toxic, natural ingredients and are classified as a Schedule 6 item under the Explosives Regulation, meaning they are safe, compliant, and risk-free for you and your loved ones.<\/p><p>For a safe and legal gender reveal, always purchase directly from Gender Reveal Ideas<strong>.<\/strong><\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_TczMPL": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are gender reveal products harmful to the environment?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Our gender reveal products are made with biodegradable materials, ensuring they are safe for the environment when used as directed. We encourage you to dispose of them properly after your reveal to minimise any environmental impact.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_CjFyid": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I place a pick-up order?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, we do offer pick-up orders! Simply select the \"Pick Up\" option during checkout, and your order will be ready for collection on the same day from our Gold Coast store. <\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Y7LGy7": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I purchase an item and have a friend specify the colour?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, we do allow purchases with colour specifications from friends! If you choose the \"To Be Announced\" option, just provide your order number to your friend. They can then discreetly inform us, and we'll ensure the right colour reaches you or them without any hints. <\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_qbYBnJ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I track my order?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, we do provide order tracking! Once your order is fulfilled, you'll receive a tracking number. This allows you to follow its journey every step of the way.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_CJjTji": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Where can I buy gender reveal cannons?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Our gender reveal cannons are available online. Browse our wide selection of confetti and powder cannons, designed for an exciting and colourful gender reveal.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_VKmN4f": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Where can I buy smoke cannons for gender reveal?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, we do have smoke cannons for gender reveals! They're available on our website at <a href=\"http:\/\/www.genderrevealideas.com.au\/\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">www.genderrevealideas.com.au<\/span><\/a>, and we offer free shipping across Australia on all orders.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_E7VmFy": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Where can I buy gender reveal sports balls?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, we do sell gender reveal sports balls! Explore our diverse selection right here at <a href=\"http:\/\/www.genderrevealideas.com.au\/\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">www.genderrevealideas.com.au<\/span><\/a>. And remember, shipping across Australia is free on every <\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_UMYi4y": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What happens if my express parcel arrives late?",
            "icon": "none",
